    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of power vested in me under Section 50(1) of the Pawn Brokers' Statute No. 04 of 2014 of the Provincial Councilof the Central Province, I, Sarath Ekanayake, the Chief Minister of the Provincial Council of Central Province and theMinister of Finance and Planning, Law and Order, Local Government, Manpower, Education and Cultural Affairs, Tourism,Land, Co-operative Development, Trade and Commerce, Food Supplies and Distribution and Investment Co-ordination dohereby order to implement the under mentioned amendments related to the Pawn Brokers' Statute, with effect from the31st day of May, 2016.",
